.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only assets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not tracked; work in progress that is not part of a release
.unused

# Where the installed loader unpacks a manually loaded pack .zip. This is the
# user's own node content, not add-on source, so it must never be committed or
# republished inside a release zip.
DragonGraph's Blender Addon/assets/extracted/

